source_event: ITK r29 omitted itkImageFillBufferTest4.1 after CMake procfs parsing failed; r31 proved the first shell parser overflowed; CI build 26077 then proved same-machine runnable Conan needs a local meminfo fallback when no task controller supplies the validated override
